    <tags>cypher-expenses expenses budget finance money ledger pdf-reports offline</tags>
    <summary>Records expenses and money in, and turns them into statements and PDF reports.</summary>
    <description>Money in, money out, and an honest answer to where it went. Cypher Expenses keeps a running balance, breaks spending down by category, and exports a detailed or summary statement as a PDF for any date range. Everything is stored on the device and it never asks you to make an account.</description>
